          "description": "Step into the world before Dorothy ever dropped in, where two unlikely friends — Elphaba and Glinda — discover who they really are and what they stand for. Wicked: The Soundtrack brings the powerful story to life with unforgettable songs like “Defying Gravity” and “Popular”, that capture themes of friendship, courage, and standing up for what you believe in.\n \nWith big vocals, dramatic duets, and timeless lyrics, it’s a musical experience that hits home for all ages. Families will love singing along, laughing at Glinda’s charm, and getting swept up in Elphaba’s journey to find her own path. Whether you're a long-time fan or hearing it for the first time, press play, and let Wicked take you somewhere wonderful.",
